{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07301","headline":"宿严维宅送包佶 · 刘长卿","name":"宿严维宅送包佶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江湖同避地，分首自依依。\n尽室今爲客，惊秋空念归。\n岁储无别墅，寒服羡邻机。\n草色春桥晚，蝉声江树稀。\n夜深宜共醉，时难忍相违。\n何事随阳雁，汀洲忽背飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07301.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07301","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}